      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544421755562229760",
      "text": "@J__Chavez @DMReporter So is a quick resolution with many casualties preferable to a lengthy siege with no bloodshed?",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:20:36 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4442130563465626e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544409432831328256",
      "text": "@DMReporter Speechless. Oh, the stupidity.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 08:31:38 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.44407393451647e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544431338292379648",
      "text": "@nolechica @Mitla96 About 250,000. Sydney has half of all Muslims in Australia. (Current Sydney population = a bit under 5 million.)",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:58:40 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444296886100992e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544427592473149441",
      "text": "@Brettreece1 @Mitla96 @katiemelb i think it depends on the state you live in.  here in fl, people think i'm an idiot for being unarmed.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:43:47 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444271273705759e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544421570257494016",
      "text": "@PeterFearns @DMReporter http://t.co/0l6hFVHe5D",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:19:51 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444084834422047e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544411984301936640",
      "text": "@Wezzo_66 Any excuse to get all tingly about their guns.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 08:41:46 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4441178468243046e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544409993051901953",
      "text": "@SharonBrooks26 Hardly surprising though...",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 08:33:51 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4440984019469926e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544486708268380160",
      "text": "@SlothNG @DMReporter @BernardKeane  US \"unintentional fatalities: Firearms 591\" Doesn't include the 10,000 plus deliberate shootings then?",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 13:38:41 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444861616964485e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544486991673700352",
      "text": "@DrGCrisp @DMReporter @BernardKeane Id be glad to provide more information and sources later after work... Lunch break is short",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 13:39:49 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.44484380899414e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544409807822651392",
      "text": "@DMReporter @BernardKeane cos' carrying guns has always prevented sieges and deaths in US hasn't it.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 08:33:07 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.44407393451647e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544425423107403776",
      "text": "@katiemelb @nolechica  Indeed, Figgy. Sadly, I can't see the US being able (let alone willing) to ban them though. :(",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:35:10 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444246420818739e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544649429395836928",
      "text": "@SlothNG @DMReporter @BernardKeane the idea that more guns results in fewer gun deaths is without any doubt an extraordinary claim.",
      "timestamp": "Tue Dec 16 00:25:17 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444997808825303e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544419402016247808",
      "text": "@DBCloggy or mass shootings , oh wait that already happens in America.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:11:14 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444083042489631e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544631808902832128",
      "text": "@Lala1448 @DMReporter The world isn't perfect, not everyone has to be armed no but the choice should be there for situations like this.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 23:15:16 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.446269847314268e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544411140713754624",
      "text": "@GlamorousLeft @DMReporter cos guns save lives.. Said no one ever #Lindt #siege #Sydney",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 08:38:25 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444104210177229e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544428449918881792",
      "text": "@Mitla96 @katiemelb @Brettreece1 yep, it always seems dumb and loud are synonymous.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:47:12 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.444281682042634e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544409793423618049",
      "text": "@DMReporter Hey America! The horrible hostage situation is NOT an opportunistic time to argue about your gun laws #getagrip #sydneysiege",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 08:33:04 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.44407393451647e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544412470648250369",
      "text": "@ClareNegus @DMReporter especially as it's never a stimulus to discuss American gun laws when they have a tragedy, according to them",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 08:43:42 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4440979342361805e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544410066137264128",
      "text": "@ClareNegus @DMReporter the best tweet I've read so far.",
