      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544487852479119360",
      "text": "@DrGCrisp @DMReporter @BernardKeane No it dosn't, I thaught that was obvious. But the 10,000 is misconstrued most off that is suicide.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 13:43:14 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4448670826838016e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544426598108499968",
      "text": "@katiemelb @Mitla96 @Brettreece1 as in daily fail? no wonder...",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 09:39:50 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4442631835643494e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544408483442204672",
      "text": "“@DMReporter: #SYDNEYSIEGE: American readers weigh in with their messages of support. http://t.co/AbyRyb5WJB” Wow.",
